00:45:32.000 --> 00:45:34.000
Dr. Khalifa: They should be down in the list.

00:45:35.000 --> 00:45:37.000
Dr. Khalifa: Down the list. A woman: Right, yeah, I know. Yeah.

00:45:41.000 --> 00:45:47.000
A woman: You just made the statement about how we should be really careful of how we think about God,

00:45:47.000 --> 00:45:57.000
